    "raw_text": "Anderson to Host Town Hall Meeting June 18 in Lewisberry\nJune 1, 2026\nHARRISBURG – State Rep. Marc Anderson (R-York) is hosting a community town hall meeting on Thursday, June 18, from 6-7:30 p.m. at Valley Grange #1360,1230 Rosstown Road in Lewisberry.\n“This meeting will give me the opportunity to hear directly from residents about the issues most important to you, such as data centers, no cell phones in classrooms, property tax elimination and more,” said Anderson. “I will also be able to provide updates about the state budget and legislation currently being considered in Harrisburg.”\nAnderson is asking those planning to attend to RSVP at\nRepMarcAnderson.com/events\n. When a person RSVPs, he or she may also submit a question or questions to be answered during the town hall.\nRepresentative Marc Anderson\n92nd District\nPennsylvania House of Representatives\nMedia Contact: Tricia Lehman\n717.772.9840\ntlehman@pahousegop.com\nrepmarcanderson.com\nShare\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
